20 0 obj
<< /A 41 0 R /Alt (Kaplan-Meier survival curve shows the proportion of infectious events increasing over 24 months, with the solid black line representing event occurrence, dashed lines showing confidence intervals, and a risk table below indicating patient counts at each interval.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 33 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
