21 0 obj
<< /A 42 0 R /Alt (Kaplan-Meier plot showing the proportion of hypogammaglobulinemia over 60 months, with a solid line representing cumulative incidence, dashed lines for confidence intervals, and tick marks indicating censored data; a table below displays the number of patients at risk at specified time points.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 34 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
22 0 obj
<< /A 43 0 R /Alt (Donut chart illustrating the distribution of the RTX treatment cycle during which first infection occurred among the 26 patients who developed infections: 21 patients \(80.77%\) developed infection during the first cycle, 1 patient \(3.85%\) during the second cycle, 2 patients \(7.69%\) during the third cycle, 1 patient \(3.85%\) during the fourth cycle, and 1 patient \(3.85%\) during the sixth cycle. Chart segments correspond in color to the labeled legend.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 36 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
